Third-party material in validation/bundles/
===========================================

This notice covers both approved distribution artifacts and excluded local qualification inputs.
validation/distribution.json is the authoritative shipping inventory:43 approved bundles,64 excluded.
Availability at an upstream URL is not treated as a redistribution grant.

Locally acquired files are pinned copies of published validation artefacts. Each bundle directory has a
manifest.json with the version, release date, effective dates, upstream source (with the SHA-256
of the downloaded archive) and the SHA-256 of every file. `bun run verify:bundles` checks them and
runs in CI. The Schematron bundles are the upstream rules compiled to SaxonJS SEF (gzip) by
`bun run build:bundles`; source assertions are preserved except for the explicitly documented build adapters below. Build adapters and original/derived hashes are recorded for affected bundles. effectiveFrom is the publication date of
the release unless the publisher states another date.

