1. ` satisfied $va = 'false'` was changed once to ` satisfies $va = 'false'`.
2. `isdoc:StoreBatch/isdoc:Quantity) satisfies` was changed once to
   `isdoc:StoreBatch/isdoc:Quantity satisfies`.
Original SCH SHA256:a992ae3de6432b01d8c27ca86a10ff33b20a2efe9b5f88c9948d2479f2972ce3.
