Both sources are preserved and hashed by the reproducible builder. The derived
bundle preserves the publisher's selected assertions apart from those disclosed
syntax repairs. Public tests exercise both repaired assertions with schema-valid
negative controls (non-VAT header with VAT line and mismatched batch quantity
units), plus the original-document-reference rule. This does not claim exhaustive
Czech tax-law, signature, timestamp or hybrid-document verification.

